# Diffusers examples

Handbook: `docs/source/en/conceptual/contribution.md` (community pipelines
and training examples).

## Community pipelines (`examples/community/`)

Experimental / one-off inference, not a new core architecture. One
`DiffusionPipeline` subclass per file, `register_modules` in `__init__`,
one `__call__`. Add a row to `examples/community/README.md`. Tutorial:
`examples/community/one_step_unet.py`.

## Official training (`examples/<name>/`, not `community` or `research_projects`)

Single-file script, `python train_….py --args`, Accelerate,
`requirements.txt`, README with a command and expected results, plus
`test_*.py` in the same folder. Neighbor: `examples/dreambooth/`.

## Research training (`examples/research_projects/<name>/`)

Same layout, no test required. README must name the maintainer (`@handle`).
Experimental training belongs here, not in official `examples/`.
